sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor E as Employee
  participant UI as Vera window
  participant API as Chat service
  participant R as Intent router
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant AI as LLM
  participant T as Tool (RAG or weather)
  E->>UI: Asks a question
  UI->>API: POST message (Bearer JWT)
  API->>DB: Check owner, ACTIVE, idle < 60 min
  Note over API: Input guardrails
  API->>DB: New conversation_id, save human_message
  API->>R: Classify intent
  R-->>API: POLICY / WEATHER / both / out of scope
  API->>DB: Load THIS session's history only
  API->>AI: History + message + allowed tool(s)
  AI-->>API: ai_tool_call (or a clarification answer)
  API->>T: Run tool (no business data)
  T-->>API: ToolResult
  API->>DB: Save tool call, result and tool log
  API->>AI: Tool result
  AI-->>API: Final answer
  Note over API: Output guardrails (grounding, citations)
  API->>DB: Save ai_response, AI log, last activity
  API-->>UI: Reply + citations / weather card
